Yes. Looking at the repo + the full product context, the right mental model is much broader than “AI RFP tool.”
Your master document defines a Proposal, Contract & Procurement Intelligence Platform . In practical terms, it is trying to combine GovWin/Deltek-style procurement intelligence + Loopio/Responsive-style proposal response management + contract/compliance management + evidence-backed pricing + document intelligence/verification + a grounded GPT analyst, all powered by the contractor’s verified historical records.
